{'symbol': 'FI', 'date': '2021-10-01 16:05:00', 'title': "EXPRO AND FRANK'S COMPLETE MERGER, CREATING A NEW FULL-CYCLE ENERGY SERVICES LEADER", 'text': "HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EXPRO GROUP, AN INTERNATIONAL ENERGY SERVICES COMPANY WITH MARKET LEADERSHIP IN WELL ACCESS AND WELL FLOW OPTIMIZATION, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS COMPLETED ITS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED MERGER WITH FRANK'S INTERNATIONAL N.V. (NYSE: FI), A GLOBAL OIL SERVICES COMPANY OFFERING A BROAD RANGE OF HIGHLY ENGINEERED DRILLING AND COMPLETIONS SOLUTIONS AND SERVICES. THE COMBINED COMPANY HAS ASSUMED THE EXPRO GROUP HOLDINGS N.V. NAME AND WILL BEGIN TRADING ON THE NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE"}